This file lists the third-party software that the Docker image runs or that the built web page contains.
Each licence was taken from the installed package's own metadata or licence files (Python packages: the
dist-info `License-Expression`, `License` or classifier fields and the files under `licenses/`; npm packages:
the `license` field of their package.json; Ghostscript: Debian's /usr/share/doc/ghostscript/copyright in the
image). Versions are those in backend/uv.lock and frontend/package-lock.json at the time of writing.
The full licence texts ship inside each package (dist-info/licenses/ for Python wheels, the package
directory for npm, /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright for Debian packages).


