System packages in the image
----------------------------

Ghostscript 10.05.1 (Debian packages ghostscript and libgs10, from the Debian release the
python:3.13-slim base image is built on)
                                AGPL-3.0-or-later ("AGPL-3+") for Ghostscript itself, per Debian's
                                copyright files; those files also list parts under other licences
                                (Apache-2.0, BSD-3-Clause, Expat variants, GPL-2, and others).
Python 3.13 and the Debian base system come from the official python:3.13-slim image; their licences are
in /usr/share/doc/ inside the image and, for Python, in the LICENSE file of the CPython distribution.


